(6580810, 981147, 116155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture.</td>', 'Wonderful capture.', '2011-11-01 08:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6580812, 981346, 47906, '<td valign="top">This photo has some really nice appeal to it, it is a good start. It has a good capture of a relfection of the sky in the water and some autumnal color changing for some good interest. <br/> <br/>One of the things that grabs me on your shot is the horizon seems as though it is tilted to the left a bit. Fixing this would make it stronger overall. The other thing I notice is the brightness of the rocks in the foreground, my eye is brought to these first and back to them as they are the brightest thing in your photo. The eye is brought to you highlights and will continuously be drawn to them, perhaps limiting the overall effect of the photo. <br/> <br/>I am not voting just commenting, Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'This photo has some really nice appeal to it, it is a good start. It has a good capture of a relfection of the sky in the water and some autumnal color changing for some good interest.  One of the things that grabs me on your shot is the horizon seems as though it is tilted to the left a bit. Fixing this would make it stronger overall. The other thing I notice is the brightness of the rocks in the foreground, my eye is brought to these first and back to them as they are the brightest thing in your photo. The eye is brought to you highlights and will continuously be drawn to them, perhaps limiting the overall effect of the photo.  I am not voting just commenting, Hope you find this helpful.', '2011-11-01 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
