(6580833, 981565, 47906, '<td valign="top">Good macro shot of the Wasp/Hornet. Your detail on the body is good, perhaps a tad sharper may help. The placement in the frame and composition is really nice, good use of rule of thirds. I love the diagonal you have created with the branch it is sitting upon. <br/> <br/>Perhaps more Depth of field would have given you a sharper body and more detail in the wings. In my opinion for macro, you really want to emphesize the entire insect when doing the macro not just the body. <br/> <br/>I am not voting just commenting, Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'Good macro shot of the Wasp/Hornet. Your detail on the body is good, perhaps a tad sharper may help. The placement in the frame and composition is really nice, good use of rule of thirds. I love the diagonal you have created with the branch it is sitting upon.  Perhaps more Depth of field would have given you a sharper body and more detail in the wings. In my opinion for macro, you really want to emphesize the entire insect when doing the macro not just the body.  I am not voting just commenting, Hope you find this helpful.', '2011-11-01 08:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
