(6580869, 981349, 124190, '<td valign="top">I like the effects of your processing.....I don''t even mind the squiggle down on the left....made me laugh for some reason.....  I bet you had fun doing this.   Did you play with ALL the tools??!!!!  lol      Actually the more I look at it the more I wonder how much you created in the shot.....keeps my interest...like....what happened to his head?   Is that what the shape down left may suggest?  I''m stuck on this now.  I sooooo prefer this to some of the super glitz eye candy tacky (whoops - puke) shots out there....and there are too many.   THIS is what I love.   10</td>', 'I like the effects of your processing.....I don''t even mind the squiggle down on the left....made me laugh for some reason.....  I bet you had fun doing this.   Did you play with ALL the tools??!!!!  lol      Actually the more I look at it the more I wonder how much you created in the shot.....keeps my interest...like....what happened to his head?   Is that what the shape down left may suggest?  I''m stuck on this now.  I sooooo prefer this to some of the super glitz eye candy tacky (whoops - puke) shots out there....and there are too many.   THIS is what I love.   10', '2011-11-01 08:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
