(6581042, 981426, 47906, '<td valign="top">Your depth is great on the reflection, the shot itself is very symmetrical. Your detail is very nice. However the photo itself feels a bit flat to me perhaps due to is being symmetrical. The horizion is dead center on the image and while there are some real nice highlights from the snow and texturing on the mountain there is no element that is giving the photo depth overall.<br/> <br/>I am not voting, only commenting. Hope you find this helpful.</td>', 'Your depth is great on the reflection, the shot itself is very symmetrical. Your detail is very nice. However the photo itself feels a bit flat to me perhaps due to is being symmetrical. The horizion is dead center on the image and while there are some real nice highlights from the snow and texturing on the mountain there is no element that is giving the photo depth overall. I am not voting, only commenting. Hope you find this helpful.', '2011-11-01 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
