(6581050, 979478, 47906, '<td valign="top">Great positioning of your horizon in this frame to give a feeling of depth. Love the sun star that you have created between the monoliths. Perhaps putting the subject a bit more off centered would give more of a dynamic feel to the photo overall. Also, not sure but it feels we are leaning slightly to the right. Could be me but thought I would mention this as well.<br/> <br/>Not voting, only commenting. Hope you find this comment useful.</td>', 'Great positioning of your horizon in this frame to give a feeling of depth. Love the sun star that you have created between the monoliths. Perhaps putting the subject a bit more off centered would give more of a dynamic feel to the photo overall. Also, not sure but it feels we are leaning slightly to the right. Could be me but thought I would mention this as well. Not voting, only commenting. Hope you find this comment useful.', '2011-11-01 10:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
