(6581244, 980599, 52130, '<td valign="top">very halloween and love the colors, but it seems odd that there is no blood on the knife. If it was dripping a little would have really made this shot a bit more dynamic. I''m not knocking you for it though.</td>', 'very halloween and love the colors, but it seems odd that there is no blood on the knife. If it was dripping a little would have really made this shot a bit more dynamic. I''m not knocking you for it though.', '2011-11-01 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
