(6581254, 980439, 83313, '<td valign="top">That depends on if you are in a car or on a bicycle. 15 is a nice clip for me. Lovely scene. Makes me want to go out and ride.</td>', 'That depends on if you are in a car or on a bicycle. 15 is a nice clip for me. Lovely scene. Makes me want to go out and ride.', '2011-11-01 13:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581256, 981023, 83313, '<td valign="top">A pretty woman and I like her expression. Her face comes off to me as a touch overprocessed. Looks slightly overcranked to my eye. (I''m calling the kettle black, I think.) There''s also a greyish area in her hair where it looks like you tried to compensate for some blown highlights.</td>', 'A pretty woman and I like her expression. Her face comes off to me as a touch overprocessed. Looks slightly overcranked to my eye. (I''m calling the kettle black, I think.) There''s also a greyish area in her hair where it looks like you tried to compensate for some blown highlights.', '2011-11-01 13:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581258, 981246, 63244, '<td valign="top">Looks like Arte Johnson...fun capture and great color/detail!</td>', 'Looks like Arte Johnson...fun capture and great color/detail!', '2011-11-01 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581272, 981317, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog and Thag go fishing in lake. <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=116574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Ooga</a>say have fun, but not understand why fishing so grate. Grog not tell.</td>', 'Grog and Thag go fishing in lake. Oogasay have fun, but not understand why fishing so grate. Grog not tell.', '2011-11-01 13:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6581283, 981517, 52130, '<td valign="top">love the processing and the angle, but I wish you had gotten a little lower to the ground and to the right so that the tree was more in the upper left hand corner and that pathway to it would have created a more dramatic diagonal towards it. I think objects that fall on thirds are more dynamic, but I still really like this landscape. 8</td>', 'love the processing and the angle, but I wish you had gotten a little lower to the ground and to the right so that the tree was more in the upper left hand corner and that pathway to it would have created a more dramatic diagonal towards it. I think objects that fall on thirds are more dynamic, but I still really like this landscape. 8', '2011-11-01 13:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
