(6581909, 979763, 62187, '<td valign="top">When I was a teenager, we had some property in Texas and had 3 of these crazy birds. They tortured me with their noise every morning! I probably shouldn''t admit it, but I was happy when they all finally died. Thanks for the memory recall...! }:&gt;| It''s a wonderfully focused photo. I think it might have more eye-appeal if the Guinea Hen were even more off-centered. As for me...extra points for fond memories...!</td>', 'When I was a teenager, we had some property in Texas and had 3 of these crazy birds. They tortured me with their noise every morning! I probably shouldn''t admit it, but I was happy when they all finally died. Thanks for the memory recall...! }:>| It''s a wonderfully focused photo. I think it might have more eye-appeal if the Guinea Hen were even more off-centered. As for me...extra points for fond memories...!', '2011-11-01 22:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
