(6582035, 981162, 75713, '<td valign="top">I have passed on this photo a few times now as it has a few stories for me and I needed to think about it .. that''s what a good photo does in my opinion - makes me think of stories .. I love the hesitancy in her pose .. the way she is holding on to a part of her hair .. her gentle cradling of her guitar .. the texture in her dress matches the texture in the b/g which creates a consistency that I also like very much .. so I am going to give it my highest portrait score for this challenge and thank you for the story .. a 9</td>', 'I have passed on this photo a few times now as it has a few stories for me and I needed to think about it .. that''s what a good photo does in my opinion - makes me think of stories .. I love the hesitancy in her pose .. the way she is holding on to a part of her hair .. her gentle cradling of her guitar .. the texture in her dress matches the texture in the b/g which creates a consistency that I also like very much .. so I am going to give it my highest portrait score for this challenge and thank you for the story .. a 9', '2011-11-02 00:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
