(6583318, 980439, 30982, '<td valign="top">The standard lovely fall shot would require you to move forward a few feet and eliminate the sign.  But shooting from where you chose, including the sign, gives the photo just a bit more "oomph" - that lovely slow lazy fall day - dictated by a sign.</td>', 'The standard lovely fall shot would require you to move forward a few feet and eliminate the sign.  But shooting from where you chose, including the sign, gives the photo just a bit more "oomph" - that lovely slow lazy fall day - dictated by a sign.', '2011-11-02 23:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
