(6584070, 981675, 124982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous bird, lovely capture! Think it could''ve benefited from a much tighter crop on the head though.</td>', 'What a gorgeous bird, lovely capture! Think it could''ve benefited from a much tighter crop on the head though.', '2011-11-03 20:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
