(6584074, 981421, 124982, '<td valign="top">Quite stunning...just has a fantastic sense of movement to it! Almost like i''m tumbling in a wave.</td>', 'Quite stunning...just has a fantastic sense of movement to it! Almost like i''m tumbling in a wave.', '2011-11-03 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
