(6584086, 981406, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of this colorful fellow and there is a very nice background as well. The subject could be sharper.<br/> <br/>Edit: It actually looks sharper to me now than it did when I voted. I would have bumped this up a point or 2. Just goes to show what eyestrain does to an an image after looking at 300 others. Sorry about that.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-08 18:28:11.</i></td>', 'Nice capture of this colorful fellow and there is a very nice background as well. The subject could be sharper. Edit: It actually looks sharper to me now than it did when I voted. I would have bumped this up a point or 2. Just goes to show what eyestrain does to an an image after looking at 300 others. Sorry about that.', '2011-11-03 21:10:50.000000', '2011-11-08 18:28:11.000000', 1),
