(6584987, 981492, 83313, '<td valign="top">Females complain that Grog not best leader for tribe. Females not know anything, but hold much power of body over Grog. Grog humor females and hold "election". Grog run against Urg, from cave next door. Grog is smart and knows of trick to win favor in election, called "slinging of mud". Grog win election and females stop sound of nagging.</td>', 'Females complain that Grog not best leader for tribe. Females not know anything, but hold much power of body over Grog. Grog humor females and hold "election". Grog run against Urg, from cave next door. Grog is smart and knows of trick to win favor in election, called "slinging of mud". Grog win election and females stop sound of nagging.', '2011-11-04 13:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6584991, 981658, 83313, '<td valign="top"><strike>Usually I''m not a fan of negative images, but it works for this.</strike> Did a screen grab and inverted it to see what it looked like normal and found this is not a negative. Black light, I suppose?</td>', 'Usually I''m not a fan of negative images, but it works for this. Did a screen grab and inverted it to see what it looked like normal and found this is not a negative. Black light, I suppose?', '2011-11-04 13:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
