(6585070, 978038, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog welcomes new female to tribe of Grog. Female have speshal kualities, will bear Grog many strong younglings that learn to read early. But bright shiny hair could make problem for male youngling hunting and fighting.</td>', 'Grog welcomes new female to tribe of Grog. Female have speshal kualities, will bear Grog many strong younglings that learn to read early. But bright shiny hair could make problem for male youngling hunting and fighting.', '2011-11-04 14:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585089, 979254, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of the age/character/determination in this portrait. <br/>Desaturation is a good idea on the shot, although I would''ve preferred a warmer sepia tone myself.<br/>For a street shot, the background is nicely defocused.<br/>All in all, a keeper in my book.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of the age/character/determination in this portrait. Desaturation is a good idea on the shot, although I would''ve preferred a warmer sepia tone myself.For a street shot, the background is nicely defocused.All in all, a keeper in my book.', '2011-11-04 14:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585102, 981524, 59796, '<td valign="top">Love the muted pastel tones and the softness in the sea and the sky. The contrasty/sharpened sand is at a little odds with the rest of the picture in that regard. The picture would look and feel better without the sand I think.</td>', 'Love the muted pastel tones and the softness in the sea and the sky. The contrasty/sharpened sand is at a little odds with the rest of the picture in that regard. The picture would look and feel better without the sand I think.', '2011-11-04 14:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585108, 981518, 59796, '<td valign="top">Unique treatment on a fall colors pic - very different from the vibrant/oversaturated pics you usually see. <br/>That, combined with the nicely exposed cloudy sky, sets a gloomy mood to the pic that is at odds with the overall brightness in the pic. If the pic were a little darker with more shadows (or if it were not a HDR?), it might present itself better?</td>', 'Unique treatment on a fall colors pic - very different from the vibrant/oversaturated pics you usually see. That, combined with the nicely exposed cloudy sky, sets a gloomy mood to the pic that is at odds with the overall brightness in the pic. If the pic were a little darker with more shadows (or if it were not a HDR?), it might present itself better?', '2011-11-04 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585149, 977832, 108580, '<td valign="top">Quick boys, we don'' wanna gets our Gucci''s wet...<br/> <br/>Very cute picture. Love it. Humour and character in wildlife images is so lacking these days.</td>', 'Quick boys, we don'' wanna gets our Gucci''s wet... Very cute picture. Love it. Humour and character in wildlife images is so lacking these days.', '2011-11-04 15:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
