(6585222, 981585, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wonderful late evening light - the long shadows add a lot of depth to the pic. The beautiful patterns in the red soil are starting to come out. And the Totems do stand out (literally too :)  Also like that the bottom is framed nicely by dry bush. <br/>The sky color however, looks quite artificial. Looks something like the result of an ''auto-color'' in PS.</td>', 'Wonderful late evening light - the long shadows add a lot of depth to the pic. The beautiful patterns in the red soil are starting to come out. And the Totems do stand out (literally too :)  Also like that the bottom is framed nicely by dry bush. The sky color however, looks quite artificial. Looks something like the result of an ''auto-color'' in PS.', '2011-11-04 16:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
