(6585228, 978327, 59796, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! Although I would''ve liked a little more DOF for the bird, the bokeh is so creamy and lovely that I don''t mind the shallow DOF. Saturating the reds a bit would''ve highlighted the ladybird that''s about to become lunch :) Low Find is a Good Find :)</td>', 'Beautiful shot! Although I would''ve liked a little more DOF for the bird, the bokeh is so creamy and lovely that I don''t mind the shallow DOF. Saturating the reds a bit would''ve highlighted the ladybird that''s about to become lunch :) Low Find is a Good Find :)', '2011-11-04 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585230, 978298, 59796, '<td valign="top">Wow! Finding the fly in the chaos it seems to be in, and capturing it so sharply in such shallow DOF - must''ve been super hard. I would''ve tweaked the colors a little to make the fly''s eyes standout more vibrantly, but it''s a fantastic capture nonetheless.</td>', 'Wow! Finding the fly in the chaos it seems to be in, and capturing it so sharply in such shallow DOF - must''ve been super hard. I would''ve tweaked the colors a little to make the fly''s eyes standout more vibrantly, but it''s a fantastic capture nonetheless.', '2011-11-04 17:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
