(6585378, 981073, 124815, '<td valign="top">Through my half-closed eyelids I began to see mirages.<br/>Somewhere between Corot and Winslow Homer.</td>', 'Through my half-closed eyelids I began to see mirages.Somewhere between Corot and Winslow Homer.', '2011-11-04 20:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585379, 979254, 124815, '<td valign="top">An Irishman? And where were you with the camera? Did he not see you? <br/>Superb portrait. great candid. Congratulations. 9 for now.</td>', 'An Irishman? And where were you with the camera? Did he not see you? Superb portrait. great candid. Congratulations. 9 for now.', '2011-11-04 20:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585382, 981349, 124815, '<td valign="top">What an image! Just at the limit between photography and painting. And very much like a Bonnard painting. <br/>Perhaps the frame of the door should have been left unprocessed, perhaps the rope ... to leave the impression of just looking through a wavy pane of glass. <br/>In any case, you made a wonderful tale of a dog that stands out.<br/>Same processing with a different subject would be too much of a hybrid. You stopped here at a great point.</td>', 'What an image! Just at the limit between photography and painting. And very much like a Bonnard painting. Perhaps the frame of the door should have been left unprocessed, perhaps the rope ... to leave the impression of just looking through a wavy pane of glass. In any case, you made a wonderful tale of a dog that stands out.Same processing with a different subject would be too much of a hybrid. You stopped here at a great point.', '2011-11-04 20:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585383, 981381, 124815, '<td valign="top">Wonderful, restrained feel. The image tells a lot of possible stories and absorbs the viewer which I think is one of the most admirable quality.<br/>(I wish there was some more space on the left, but this is a detail. Wonderful shots are demanding!)<br/> <br/>Oh, and wonderful processing!</td>', 'Wonderful, restrained feel. The image tells a lot of possible stories and absorbs the viewer which I think is one of the most admirable quality.(I wish there was some more space on the left, but this is a detail. Wonderful shots are demanding!) Oh, and wonderful processing!', '2011-11-04 20:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6585399, 981088, 124815, '<td valign="top">...said she blushing! Really beautiful NG shot.<br/>Very hard in FS to separate the technically good from the daring, moody ones or the NG ones, candids ... While I truly admire the insect macros I just want a little more, and I think that you got it here.</td>', '...said she blushing! Really beautiful NG shot.Very hard in FS to separate the technically good from the daring, moody ones or the NG ones, candids ... While I truly admire the insect macros I just want a little more, and I think that you got it here.', '2011-11-04 20:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
