(6586136, 981319, 63218, '<td valign="top">The light implied here is beautiful &amp; the texture in the BG gives the impression this Iris is flying or maybe quivering. The tiny touch of turquoise reminds me of hummingbird feathers. This must''ve been so much fun to PP. The Iris is living proof that anything worth doing, is worth doing to excess. Although this has the possibility of being an excellent documentary record of the Iris, IMO the sensual heat in this totally dominates! Please accept this Gilded Lily in appreciation of a job well done.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=981180" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981180.jpg"/></a></td>', 'The light implied here is beautiful & the texture in the BG gives the impression this Iris is flying or maybe quivering. The tiny touch of turquoise reminds me of hummingbird feathers. This must''ve been so much fun to PP. The Iris is living proof that anything worth doing, is worth doing to excess. Although this has the possibility of being an excellent documentary record of the Iris, IMO the sensual heat in this totally dominates! Please accept this Gilded Lily in appreciation of a job well done.', '2011-11-05 22:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
