(6586155, 981059, 63218, '<td valign="top">This off-beat comp with the poster edges only on the in-focus petals is strange to my eye. Don''t know how to react to it.</td>', 'This off-beat comp with the poster edges only on the in-focus petals is strange to my eye. Don''t know how to react to it.', '2011-11-05 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586160, 980159, 63218, '<td valign="top">If there was such a thing as street photography for flowers, this would be it. Like the one face in the crowd that happens to be in focus is also looking directly into your lens, without seeing you. And you just happen to already have your finger on the trigger. "D Plus, that clear diffused light is letting all the many subtleties through. If I get a shot like this it''s usually the first one I take, before I start thinking about it. Please accept this Gilded Lily &amp; my compliments for a job well done.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=981203" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63218/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981203.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-08 00:57:21.</i></td>', 'If there was such a thing as street photography for flowers, this would be it. Like the one face in the crowd that happens to be in focus is also looking directly into your lens, without seeing you. And you just happen to already have your finger on the trigger. "D Plus, that clear diffused light is letting all the many subtleties through. If I get a shot like this it''s usually the first one I take, before I start thinking about it. Please accept this Gilded Lily & my compliments for a job well done.', '2011-11-05 23:08:25.000000', '2011-11-08 00:57:21.000000', 1),
