(6586833, 981491, 140026, '<td valign="top">the skyline (from middle to right), is it a mountain or a hill top with trees or what? I know it''s a silohete here,  but i was expecting to see some ''feathering'' instead of such a sharp line here.  feathering would indicate tops of trees, the strong sunset light shining through.   i really like the sunset ripples in the water</td>', 'the skyline (from middle to right), is it a mountain or a hill top with trees or what? I know it''s a silohete here,  but i was expecting to see some ''feathering'' instead of such a sharp line here.  feathering would indicate tops of trees, the strong sunset light shining through.   i really like the sunset ripples in the water', '2011-11-06 20:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586836, 981321, 140026, '<td valign="top">i like the bird in foreground used to give the rocks a sense of scale. and the greyed-out distance removes clutter from the composition.</td>', 'i like the bird in foreground used to give the rocks a sense of scale. and the greyed-out distance removes clutter from the composition.', '2011-11-06 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
