(6586957, 981319, 108580, '<td valign="top">Very!<br/>This is one of the most professional floral images I have seen in recent years. Soft, beautifully lit with a buttery BG to die for. Simple pastels. Kudos.</td>', 'Very!This is one of the most professional floral images I have seen in recent years. Soft, beautifully lit with a buttery BG to die for. Simple pastels. Kudos.', '2011-11-06 23:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586958, 978327, 108580, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. Spot on focus with the very shallow DOF. That little lady bug is about to be toast! How many people took the time to <u>look</u> at this image? The low angle is also perfect for this type of shot. WD!</td>', 'Fabulous. Spot on focus with the very shallow DOF. That little lady bug is about to be toast! How many people took the time to look at this image? The low angle is also perfect for this type of shot. WD!', '2011-11-06 23:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586959, 981064, 108580, '<td valign="top">Superb.</td>', 'Superb.', '2011-11-06 23:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586962, 981162, 104230, '<td valign="top">Lovely. Great choice of background for this excellent shot. I''m a bit confused by the title, unless you are doing a series of studies, and even then the emotion I feel conveyed here is not intimacy.  The hands in particular, and also the facial expression, to me convey a feeling of insecurity rather than intimacy. Love the Celtic coloring of hair/eyes, and how you picked this up in the dress and background.</td>', 'Lovely. Great choice of background for this excellent shot. I''m a bit confused by the title, unless you are doing a series of studies, and even then the emotion I feel conveyed here is not intimacy.  The hands in particular, and also the facial expression, to me convey a feeling of insecurity rather than intimacy. Love the Celtic coloring of hair/eyes, and how you picked this up in the dress and background.', '2011-11-06 23:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586964, 979254, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now that''s a face with character!  Excellent catch.</td>', 'Now that''s a face with character!  Excellent catch.', '2011-11-06 23:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586979, 980805, 83313, '<td valign="top">This is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113156" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jagar</a> shot if I''ve ever seen one. I was curious what these streets looked like in color.</td>', 'This is a  Jagar shot if I''ve ever seen one. I was curious what these streets looked like in color.', '2011-11-07 00:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6586984, 980813, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting how our brains work. Despite all the western themed shots I do, when I read the title, I''m visualizing something with 2 wheels, not 4 legs.</td>', 'It''s interesting how our brains work. Despite all the western themed shots I do, when I read the title, I''m visualizing something with 2 wheels, not 4 legs.', '2011-11-07 00:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
