(6587710, 981549, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, the wispy clouds are cool.<br/> <br/>One thing that really distracts me is the leaning buildings. This is something you should watch out for when shooting with a wide angle lens. It''s pretty easy to correct in post processing, and it makes the image look much more professional.</td>', 'Nice exposure, the wispy clouds are cool. One thing that really distracts me is the leaning buildings. This is something you should watch out for when shooting with a wide angle lens. It''s pretty easy to correct in post processing, and it makes the image look much more professional.', '2011-11-07 14:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
