(6589388, 981481, 19708, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bergiekat:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice to see you back!! This is wonderful (and underapreciated!!)<br/>What are you teaching<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=981930" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63244/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981930.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63244/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981930.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/60000-64999/63244/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_981930.gif"/></a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''m back in the Automotive world, teaching technicians new technology, emissions, diagnostics and diagnostic equipment. Ford, GM, Toyota, Honda, Chrysler, Jeep, VW, Audi, Hybrids, you name it.<br/>I teach technicians all over the West Coast, from Washington, Oregon, California, Arizona and Colorado.<br/>Pretty cool. It''s what I know, so why not.</td>', 'Originally posted by bergiekat: Nice to see you back!! This is wonderful (and underapreciated!!)What are you teaching  I''m back in the Automotive world, teaching technicians new technology, emissions, diagnostics and diagnostic equipment. Ford, GM, Toyota, Honda, Chrysler, Jeep, VW, Audi, Hybrids, you name it.I teach technicians all over the West Coast, from Washington, Oregon, California, Arizona and Colorado.Pretty cool. It''s what I know, so why not.', '2011-11-08 11:35:03.000000', NULL, 0),
