(7168297, 981368, 98339, '<td valign="top">I look at this and see beautiful perfection.  I would love to capture one of these birds in nature!!!  Some day....<br/> <br/>I did not vote on this picture but the only outstanding thing that I see that could have improved this (IMO) is that if you had done - 1 resizing - then ran a High Pass Filter on this...that would have made your bird really pop in the picture.  I would be very curious to see this one beside another one with the High Pass Filter....<br/> <br/>You have a stunning picture here...</td>', 'I look at this and see beautiful perfection.  I would love to capture one of these birds in nature!!!  Some day.... I did not vote on this picture but the only outstanding thing that I see that could have improved this (IMO) is that if you had done - 1 resizing - then ran a High Pass Filter on this...that would have made your bird really pop in the picture.  I would be very curious to see this one beside another one with the High Pass Filter.... You have a stunning picture here...', '2014-02-02 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7398699, 980599, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is killer. Pun intended I guess. All I want to do is clean up that blood (meaning it fits the upcoming challenge wonderfully).<br/>IMHO of course. It may not suit the tastes of some, but this is sort of very foreign to what people have come to see (at least here in the states) - because everything is mechanized and invisible. If you could shoot something of this vain again, I think it would be perfect.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2015-08-20 08:48:38.</i></td>', 'This is killer. Pun intended I guess. All I want to do is clean up that blood (meaning it fits the upcoming challenge wonderfully).IMHO of course. It may not suit the tastes of some, but this is sort of very foreign to what people have come to see (at least here in the states) - because everything is mechanized and invisible. If you could shoot something of this vain again, I think it would be perfect.', '2015-08-20 08:52:38.000000', '2015-08-20 09:48:38.000000', 0),
